<title>HUNGARY: BUDAPEST BSE SUSPENDS TRADING IN GLOBUS .</title>
<headline>BUDAPEST BSE SUSPENDS TRADING IN GLOBUS .</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Budapest Stock Exchange suspended trading in the shares of canned food maker Globus Rt on Monday following a too rapid intraday price rise, a stock exchange official told Reuters.</p>
<p>The stock reached a new record high of 2,150 forints, after surging more than 20 percent.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
